3/29/96

This is a beta class for MUI3.3. It is a textfield gadget.
Please use the header file and recompile with it with each new
version of textfield. Put textfield.mcc and textfield.mcp in
mui:libs/mui/. Any bug reports or suggestions mail to
kbellve@umabnet.ab.umd.edu

I am working on my PhD dissertation now and don't have much time to work
on it this month but I will fix the many small bugs when I can.

version 13.11 of textfield.mcc is current.


If you like to use this class in your program, there are certain restrictions:

1) Please inform the user of your program to get all current releases of
   textfield.mcc and textfield.mcp, which are available here.

2) Textfield is free for use in programs that are public domain.

3) Shareware and commercial programs need to negotiate a small % of their
   gross revenue. The percentage depends upon how big of a role the textfield
   class has in the program, and it is negotiable.


Karl

kbellve@umabnet.ab.umd.edu



